  "qid": "271",
  "tip": "<p>First decide the required availability scope. If you do not need to survive a regional outage then prefer a <i>regional</i> Spanner instance for lower cost and scale out by adding nodes. Choose <i>multi-region</i> only when cross region availability or local reads in multiple continents are mandatory.</p>",
